<title>NETHERLANDS: Martinair to up Dutch air cargo rates in Oct.</title>
<headline>Martinair to up Dutch air cargo rates in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch carrier Martinair will increase its cargo rates from the Netherlands in October, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The rise is likely to be in the region of five to ten percent, although the details have not been finalised, he added. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
